    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$1.82 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for coconut red curry chicken over rice. The restaurant version is $15 a plate, which means this batch pays for itself before you finish the second container.",
    "shop_smart":  [
                       "Boneless skinless chicken breast is the whole protein bill at about $12.86 for 5.25 pounds. Club-pack pricing under $2.50 a pound is the target, and this recipe is why you keep some in the freezer.",
